{
  "welcome": {
    "subject": "Welcome to Betterflag: your first flag is 5 minutes away",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><head><meta content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"/></head><body style=\"background:#f4f3f1;margin:0;padding:0\"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style=\"display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0\" data-skip-in-text=\"true\">Create a flag, curl the edge, watch it flip. About 5 minutes.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f3f1;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;padding:32px 16px\"><tbody><tr style=\"width:100%\"><td><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:0 4px 20px\"><tbody><tr><td><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody style=\"width:100%\"><tr style=\"width:100%\"><td data-id=\"__react-email-column\" style=\"width:34px\"><div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:#222222;color:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:34px;text-align:center\">S</div></td><td data-id=\"__react-email-column\" style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#171717\">Betterflag</span></td><td data-id=\"__react-email-column\" style=\"width:44px;padding-left:14px;text-align:right\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"34\" src=\"{{orgLogoUrl}}\" style=\"display:{{orgLogoDisplay}};outline:none;border:1px solid #e8e4de;text-decoration:none;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;object-fit:cover\" width=\"34\"/></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e8e4de;border-radius:24px;padding:40px 36px\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ff5a1a;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\">Welcome</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#171717\">Your first flag is 5 minutes away</h1><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;\">Hey, Mehdi here. I built Betterflag.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;\">Thanks for creating <strong style=\"color:#171717;\">{{orgName}}</strong>. Here's the whole pitch in one line:</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\"><tr><td style=\"background:#f6f5f3;border:1px solid #e8e4de;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:600;color:#171717;\">Unlimited flags, seats and environments. One meter (evaluations). Served from the edge in under 50ms.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#737373;\">No seat tax. No MAU bill.</p></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;\">The fastest way to feel it: create a flag, curl the edge, watch it flip. The onboarding checklist walks you through it in about 5 minutes.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:4px 0 28px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ff5a1a\" style=\"border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"https://dashboard.betterflag.app/onboarding\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:12px;\">Ship your first flag &rarr;</a></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#737373;\">Your 14-day trial is running: every feature, no card. If anything feels off, hit reply and tell me. I read all of it.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;\">- Mehdi</p></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:20px 24px 0\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#737373;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0\">You&#x27;re getting this because you created a Betterflag account. It&#x27;s a short 3-email onboarding series, then I&#x27;ll leave your inbox alone. Reply any time, it lands in my actual inbox.</p><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#a3a3a3;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0\">Betterflag · Feature flags with no seat tax and no MAU bill.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
    "text": "Hey, Mehdi here. I built Betterflag.\n\nThanks for creating {{orgName}}. Here's the whole pitch in one line: unlimited flags, seats and environments, one meter (evaluations), served from the edge in under 50ms. No seat tax, no MAU bill.\n\nThe fastest way to feel it: create a flag, curl the edge, watch it flip. The onboarding checklist walks you through it in about 5 minutes.\n\nShip your first flag: https://dashboard.betterflag.app/onboarding\n\nYour 14-day trial is running: every feature, no card. If anything feels off, hit reply and tell me. I read all of it.\n\n- Mehdi\n\n---\nYou're getting this because you created a Betterflag account. It's a short 3-email onboarding series, then I'll leave your inbox alone. Reply any time, it lands in my actual inbox."
  },
  "agentic": {
    "subject": "Let your agent manage your flags (this is the good part)",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><head><meta content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"/></head><body style=\"background:#f4f3f1;margin:0;padding:0\"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style=\"display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0\" data-skip-in-text=\"true\">Point Claude Code or Cursor at mcp.betterflag.app and let it ship.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f3f1;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;padding:32px 16px\"><tbody><tr style=\"width:100%\"><td><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:0 4px 20px\"><tbody><tr><td><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody style=\"width:100%\"><tr style=\"width:100%\"><td data-id=\"__react-email-column\" style=\"width:34px\"><div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:#222222;color:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:34px;text-align:center\">S</div></td><td data-id=\"__react-email-column\" style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#171717\">Betterflag</span></td><td data-id=\"__react-email-column\" style=\"width:44px;padding-left:14px;text-align:right\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"34\" src=\"{{orgLogoUrl}}\" style=\"display:{{orgLogoDisplay}};outline:none;border:1px solid #e8e4de;text-decoration:none;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;object-fit:cover\" width=\"34\"/></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e8e4de;border-radius:24px;padding:40px 36px\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ff5a1a;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\">Agentic</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#171717\">Let your agent manage your flags</h1><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;\">The thing that makes Betterflag different: your coding agent can drive it.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;\">Point Claude Code or Cursor at <span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#f6f5f3;border:1px solid #e8e4de;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:6px;color:#171717;\">mcp.betterflag.app</span> with an agent key and it can create flags, set targeting, stage a 10% rollout, and kill a bad feature, all without you opening the dashboard. Every action lands in the audit log attributed to the agent, not mushed in with human changes.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\"><tr><td style=\"background:#21252b;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:10px 16px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#9aa4b2;letter-spacing:0.02em;\">.mcp.json</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background:#16181d;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;padding:16px 18px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#c9d1d9;\"><span style=\"color:#8b949e;\">{</span><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#79c0ff;\">\"mcpServers\"</span>: {<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#79c0ff;\">\"betterflag\"</span>: {<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#79c0ff;\">\"type\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#00bc72;\">\"http\"</span>,<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#79c0ff;\">\"url\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#00bc72;\">\"https://mcp.betterflag.app/mcp\"</span>,<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#79c0ff;\">\"headers\"</span>: { <span style=\"color:#79c0ff;\">\"Authorization\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#00bc72;\">\"Bearer bf_agt_...\"</span> }<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br /><span style=\"color:#8b949e;\">}</span></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;\"><strong style=\"color:#171717;\">Setup is one key and one config block:</strong></p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\"><tr><td width=\"26\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 12px 12px 0;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:22px;height:22px;background:#f6f5f3;border:1px solid #e8e4de;border-radius:9999px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:22px;text-align:center;color:#171717;\">1</span></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#171717;\">Mint an agent key in <a href=\"https://dashboard.betterflag.app/settings/keys\" style=\"color:#171717;font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline;\">Settings → Keys</a></td></tr><tr><td width=\"26\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 12px 12px 0;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:22px;height:22px;background:#f6f5f3;border:1px solid #e8e4de;border-radius:9999px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:22px;text-align:center;color:#171717;\">2</span></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#171717;\">Add the MCP server to your agent's config</td></tr><tr><td width=\"26\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 12px 12px 0;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:22px;height:22px;background:#f6f5f3;border:1px solid #e8e4de;border-radius:9999px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:22px;text-align:center;color:#171717;\">3</span></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#171717;\">Ask it to \"create a flag and roll it out to 10%\"</td></tr></table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:4px 0 28px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ff5a1a\" style=\"border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"https://dashboard.betterflag.app/settings/keys\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:12px;\">Mint an agent key &rarr;</a></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#737373;\">Feature flags made easy, with unlimited seats on every plan.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;\">- Mehdi</p></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:20px 24px 0\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#737373;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0\">You&#x27;re getting this because you created a Betterflag account. It&#x27;s a short 3-email onboarding series, then I&#x27;ll leave your inbox alone. Reply any time, it lands in my actual inbox.</p><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#a3a3a3;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0\">Betterflag · Feature flags with no seat tax and no MAU bill.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
    "text": "The thing that makes Betterflag different: your coding agent can drive it.\n\nPoint Claude Code or Cursor at mcp.betterflag.app with an agent key and it can create flags, set targeting, stage a 10% rollout, and kill a bad feature, all without you opening the dashboard. Every action lands in the audit log attributed to the agent, not mushed in with human changes.\n\nSetup is one key and one config block:\n\n1. Mint an agent key in Settings → Keys: https://dashboard.betterflag.app/settings/keys\n2. Add the MCP server to your agent's config\n3. Ask it to \"create a flag and roll it out to 10%\"\n\nFeature flags made easy, with unlimited seats on every plan.\n\n- Mehdi\n\n---\nYou're getting this because you created a Betterflag account. It's a short 3-email onboarding series, then I'll leave your inbox alone. Reply any time, it lands in my actual inbox."
  },
  "trial-ending": {
    "subject": "Your Betterflag trial ends {{when}}",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><head><meta content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"/></head><body style=\"background:#f4f3f1;margin:0;padding:0\"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style=\"display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0\" data-skip-in-text=\"true\">Your Betterflag trial ends {{when}}. Your flags keep serving either way.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f3f1;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;padding:32px 16px\"><tbody><tr style=\"width:100%\"><td><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:0 4px 20px\"><tbody><tr><td><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody style=\"width:100%\"><tr style=\"width:100%\"><td data-id=\"__react-email-column\" style=\"width:34px\"><div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:#222222;color:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:34px;text-align:center\">S</div></td><td data-id=\"__react-email-column\" style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#171717\">Betterflag</span></td><td data-id=\"__react-email-column\" style=\"width:44px;padding-left:14px;text-align:right\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"34\" src=\"{{orgLogoUrl}}\" style=\"display:{{orgLogoDisplay}};outline:none;border:1px solid #e8e4de;text-decoration:none;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;object-fit:cover\" width=\"34\"/></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e8e4de;border-radius:24px;padding:40px 36px\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ff5a1a;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\">Trial</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#171717\">Your trial ends {{when}}</h1><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;\">Quick heads-up: your trial ends <strong style=\"color:#171717;\">{{when}}</strong>.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\"><tr><td style=\"background:#f6f5f3;border:1px solid #e8e4de;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#00bc72;\">&#10003;</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#171717;\">Your flags <strong>keep serving from the edge</strong>. I will never break your production over billing.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"18\" style=\"padding:0 10px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#737373;\">&middot;</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#737373;\">The dashboard and API go read-only until you pick a plan.</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;\">Plans start at $9.99/mo for 2M evaluations, and every tier has unlimited flags, seats and environments. Public pricing, no \"contact sales\".</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:4px 0 28px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ff5a1a\" style=\"border-radius:12px;\"><a href=\"https://dashboard.betterflag.app/settings\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:12px;\">Pick a plan &rarr;</a></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#737373;\">Not convinced? Reply and tell me why: worst case you help me fix something, best case I change your mind.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;\">- Mehdi</p></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:20px 24px 0\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#737373;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0\">You&#x27;re getting this because you created a Betterflag account. It&#x27;s a short 3-email onboarding series, then I&#x27;ll leave your inbox alone. Reply any time, it lands in my actual inbox.</p><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#a3a3a3;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0\">Betterflag · Feature flags with no seat tax and no MAU bill.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
    "text": "Quick heads-up: your trial ends {{when}}.\n\nHere's what happens if you do nothing: your flags keep serving from the edge (I will never break your production over billing), but the dashboard and API go read-only until you pick a plan.\n\nPlans start at $9.99/mo for 2M evaluations, and every tier has unlimited flags, seats and environments. Public pricing, no \"contact sales\".\n\nPick a plan: https://dashboard.betterflag.app/settings\n\nNot convinced? Reply and tell me why: worst case you help me fix something, best case I change your mind.\n\n- Mehdi\n\n---\nYou're getting this because you created a Betterflag account. It's a short 3-email onboarding series, then I'll leave your inbox alone. Reply any time, it lands in my actual inbox."
  }
}